OL,3,GNEWSAKatherine Jenkins says one paper
OL,4,Awarned it would 'trash her' during
OL,5,Aearly career
OL,6,
OL,7,FKatherine Jenkins has reflected on the
OL,8,F"crazy" questions she was asked by the
OL,9,Fpress as a young classical singer.
OL,11,FThe mezzo-soprano, who has had 14
OL,12,Fnumber one albums, is about to start a
OL,13,Ftour marking 25 years as one of the
OL,14,Fworld's most successful classical
OL,15,Fsingers.
OL,17,FJenkins, 46, from Neath, said she had
OL,18,F"found her own voice" and learnt to
OL,19,Ftake control of her career over the
OL,20,Fyears, adding she was often staggered
OL,21,Fby the things journalists would say to
OL,22,Fher.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,435,430,260,140,0,100
