OL,3,GNEWSAKatherine Jenkins says one paper
OL,4,Awarned it would 'trash her' during
OL,5,Aearly career
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I would often get asked 'who's looking
OL,8,Fafter your children?' That's crazy. You
OL,9,Fwouldn't get tenors asked that
OL,10,Fquestion," she told BBC Radio Wales.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
